    "ethos": {
      "type": "od-image-text",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/OILILY_studio_SS26_53_1024x1024_77949aad-f654-4ade-b4cb-97d57510c274.webp",
        "ratio": "4-5",
        "image_side": "start",
        "eyebrow": "The ethos",
        "title": "Joy, drawn by hand",
        "text": "<p>Oilily was born in 1963 in Alkmaar, the Netherlands, when Willem and Marieke Olsthoorn decided their own children deserved clothes with personality. Six decades on, the house still designs its prints by hand, still mixes patterns other brands would keep apart, and still believes that getting dressed should be the happiest moment of the day.</p><p>Every piece is made to last through play and to be handed down, which is why the collections are cut generously, sewn to be washed a hundred times and printed in colours that stay bright.</p>",
        "button_label": "Shop all Oilily",
        "button_url": "/collections/vendors?q=Oilily",
        "button_style": "solid",
        "button_color": "#551c25",
        "button_text_color": "#fcf8f2",
